=== Approach ===
Used Python iii-sdk (pip install iii-sdk) to connect directly to iii-engine
WebSocket at ws://localhost:49134. Called state::get/state::set/state::list/
state::delete for each record. This ensures the iii-engine's binary format
(JSON + 9-byte footer) is always correctly serialized.

Key insight: observations are stored in separate scope mem:obs:<session_id>,
not nested within session metadata (mem:sessions). Both scopes needed migration.

